{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"西番雅書","commonName":"西番雅書","title":"西番雅書","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"4d1e9971ea998a363ca860048ef6d06977238fc9a10c7eaa9b21fe90af9c4689","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":52},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的罪惡和救贖"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"這悖逆、污穢、欺壓的城有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不聽從命令，不領受訓誨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不倚靠耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不親近她的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她中間的首領是咆哮的獅子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的審判官是晚上的豺狼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一點食物也不留到早晨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的先知是虛浮詭詐的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的祭司褻瀆聖所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強解律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華在她中間是公義的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斷不做非義的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每早晨顯明他的公義，無日不然；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是不義的人不知羞恥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我－耶和華已經除滅列國的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的城樓毀壞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他們的街道荒涼，以致無人經過；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的城邑毀滅，以致無人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也無居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說：你只要敬畏我，領受訓誨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如此，你的住處不致照我所擬定的除滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是你們從早起來就在一切事上敗壞自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：你們要等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到我興起擄掠的日子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我已定意招聚列國，聚集列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我的惱怒－就是我的烈怒都傾在她們身上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的忿怒如火，必燒滅全地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"那時，我必使萬民用清潔的言語","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好求告我－耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同心合意地事奉我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祈禱我的，就是我所分散的民","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必從古實河外來，給我獻供物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當那日，你必不因你一切得罪我的事自覺羞愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為那時我必從你中間除掉矜誇高傲之輩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也不再於我的聖山狂傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻要在你中間留下困苦貧寒的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必投靠我－耶和華的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列所剩下的人必不作罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不說謊言，口中也沒有詭詐的舌頭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且吃喝躺臥，無人驚嚇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["歡樂之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"錫安的民哪，應當歌唱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，應當歡呼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的民哪，應當滿心歡喜快樂！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已經除去你的刑罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趕出你的仇敵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的王－耶和華在你中間；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不再懼怕災禍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當那日，必有話向耶路撒冷說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要懼怕！錫安哪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要手軟！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－你的上帝是施行拯救、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大有能力的主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在你中間必因你歡欣喜樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"默然愛你，且因你喜樂而歡呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些屬你、為無大會愁煩、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你擔當羞辱的，我必聚集他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我必罰辦一切苦待你的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又拯救你瘸腿的，聚集你被趕出的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些在全地受羞辱的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他們得稱讚，有名聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我必領你們進來，聚集你們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使你們被擄之人歸回的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必使你們在地上的萬民中有名聲，得稱讚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子；下同","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HAG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}